---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Support — TenLing" description="Help with opening, saving, editing, and presenting Markdown in TenLing.">
  <main id="main" class="prose opening">
    <h1>Here to help.</h1>
    <h2>Write and save</h2>
    <p>Choose New Document, or open a Markdown file. Save with the disk button. The document menu contains Save as, Find and replace, and export options. On a narrow screen, swipe the formatting row to reach more tools.</p>
    <h2>Your files</h2>
    <p>Documents remain ordinary .md files. If a file cannot be reopened after you move it or change file-provider access, open it again using the file picker.</p>
    <h2>Report a problem</h2>
    <p>Include your TenLing version, operating system, and the steps that reproduce the issue. Remove personal information and private document contents before sharing screenshots or examples.</p>
    <p><a class="btn btn--fill" href="https://github.com/SihanTeng/tenling/issues">Get support on GitHub</a></p>
    <p><a href="/privacy">Read the privacy policy</a></p>
  </main>
</Base>
